VEGARM CHAT APP - FEATURE LIST (MINOR TO MAJOR)
==============================================

CORE MESSAGING
--------------
- Real-time one-on-one chat
- Text message support (up to 5000 characters)
- Image sharing (Upload to server, display in chat)
- Message Status: Sending (gray)
- Message Status: Delivered (single check)
- Message Status: Seen (double blue check)
- Delete for Me (Local removal)
- Delete for Everyone (Soft delete with placeholder)
- Clear Conversation (Physical DB deletion)
- Long Press options menu
- Copy message text to clipboard
- Auto-polling (3s sync)

UI/UX & DESIGN
--------------
- Premium Glassmorphism UI (Translucent components)
- Smart Auto-Scroll (only if already at bottom)
- Persistence of scroll position per chat
- Persistence of last opened chat
- Visual sending animations
- Failed message indicators
- Retry logic for failed messages
- Empty state screens for new chats
- Themed avatars (Multiple choices)
- Responsive layout (Mobile & Web)
- Safe Area padding for notches
- Multi-line dynamic text input
- Haptic-ready interactions

REACTIONS & INPUT
-----------------
- Emoji reactions on messages
- Unified emoji picker
- Attachment overlay menu
- Fast-clear text input on send
- Image upload progress states

USER & SOCIAL
-------------
- Secure Login/Logout
- Profile management (Avatar, Username, Bio)
- Online status / Last seen tracking
- Friend requests (Send, Accept, Reject)
- Unfriend functionality
- Block/Unblock users
- Report user with reason
- View profile within chat view

SETTINGS & PRIVACY
------------------
- Global Auto-Delete (Off, 10m, 24h, 7d, 30d, 90d)
- Mute Chat (8h, 1w, Always, None)
- Notification toggle (Master switch)
- Storage of settings in AsyncStorage

STABILITY & SECURITY
--------------------
- Rate Limiting (Prevent spamming)
- Background/Foreground sync (Auto-refresh on resume)
- Timeout handling for slow networks
- Abort controller for network requests
- Server-side validation for all actions

